  "notes": [
    "All BEA datasets (NIPA, FixedAssets, GDPbyIndustry) share the same base URL and API key but use different DataSetName values.",
    "BEA NIPA Chapter 5 tables cover 1998-2024 (detailed D-suffix tables); Chapter 6 tables cover 1929-2025 (summary tables).",
    "GDPbyIndustry dataset provides NAICS-era data (1997-2024 only); pre-1997 SIC-era gross output is NOT available via API.",
    "BLS CES series IDs follow the pattern CESssssssssNNN where s=supersector/industry and NNN=data type (001=all employees, 006=production workers).",
    "FRED TCU series begins 1967; for pre-1967 capacity utilization, alternative sources (Federal Reserve historical) are needed.",
    "All output files are stored under Inputs/API_Data/{BEA,BLS,FRED}/ with provenance JSON files tracking each pull.",
    "Rate limits are per API key; BEA NIPA, Fixed Assets, and GDPbyIndustry share the same 100 req/min quota."
  ]
}
